{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 1, "text": "米拉！不！妳瘋了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 3, "text": "哈哈！我看到了甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 4, "text": "你臉上又出現了新表情？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 5, "text": "來吧，再多來點！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 6, "text": "光是看著實在是太無聊了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 8, "text": "// Mita arena \"Hello\""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 9, "text": "你好呀，我不安分的小傢伙？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 10, "text": "還沒玩夠嗎？還想四處亂跑嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 11, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 12, "text": "妳對米拉做了甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 14, "text": "看來你還沒玩夠呢！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 15, "text": "那我們再來玩玩吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 17, "text": "妳…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 19, "text": "我們先來做個小測試！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 20, "text": "檢查一下你的協調性怎麼樣！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 21, "text": "測試一下你的行為模式！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 22, "text": "萬一你真的有甚麼問題呢！？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 23, "text": "萬一你其實根本配不上，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 24, "text": "身上那引以為傲的皮膚呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 25, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 26, "text": "// Show knifes"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 27, "text": "看清楚喲，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 28, "text": "你想要哪一把？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 29, "text": "右邊這把"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 30, "text": "還是"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 31, "text": "左邊這把？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 32, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 33, "text": "// Throw knifes"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 34, "text": "你是認真的嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 35, "text": "這兩把刀有甚麼區別嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 36, "text": "只是活躍氣氛啦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 37, "text": "算了，刀子甚麼的已經是上世紀的老把戲了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 38, "text": "隨便吧"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 39, "text": "我有更好的主意，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 40, "text": "首先…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 41, "text": "// Show recorder"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 42, "text": "看看這是甚麼！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 43, "text": "我們來點音樂吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 44, "text": "這首曲子怎麼樣？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 45, "text": "是不是超級有感覺！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 46, "text": "好啦，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 47, "text": "我來說說規則吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 48, "text": "// Show rule"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 49, "text": "音樂響起的時候，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 50, "text": "你就可以移動了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 51, "text": "如果音樂停了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 52, "text": "你就不能動啦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 53, "text": "不然你就死翹翹咯。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 54, "text": "你一定要跑到終點哦。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 55, "text": "你肯定能做到的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 56, "text": "那我們就開始玩吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 57, "text": "還楞在那裡幹甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 58, "text": "跑啊，寶貝，快跑！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 60, "text": "// Ready recorder"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 61, "text": "哇！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 62, "text": "你可真聽話啊！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 63, "text": "真是個完美的樣本！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 64, "text": "好想把你佔為己有呢！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 65, "text": "不過這有點太簡單了，不是嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 67, "text": "放我走！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 69, "text": "別想偷懶哦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 70, "text": "我們還有很多遊戲要玩呢！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 71, "text": "這樣吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 72, "text": "現在我要閉上眼睛…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 73, "text": "當我睜開眼睛的時候，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 74, "text": "可不要讓我看到你哦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 75, "text": "懂了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 76, "text": "要是被我看到了，我就要好好教訓你咯！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 77, "text": "好了，我們開始吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 79, "text": "這毫無意義…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 80, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 81, "text": "// Ready hide"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 82, "text": "你贏啦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 83, "text": "真厲害！太棒了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 84, "text": "不過接下去會更難哦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 85, "text": "難上好幾倍…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 86, "text": "快躲起來！快跑，動起來！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 88, "text": "該死的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 89, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 90, "text": "// Player fall"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 91, "text": "似乎逃過去了…"}
